Grouping words (pair, tuple, triple, multiple) usually get negative values.
Articles and mathematical modifiers strengthen selected cases; a following
'of' retains some signal.  Completing split stems and internal up/ple pieces
also gets negative values.  Internal il/ur continuations get positive values
conditioned on their preceding letter, with weaker ul/ip/li rules.
Other activity is left at zero.  State resets at document boundaries.
