"""A spelling-pattern approximation, chiefly for Greek δε and triangle markers.

Separately tokenized delta followed by epsilon is strongly negative,
particularly at a word boundary or in νδε. Related Greek spellings are
weaker; some immediate continuations of δε receive smaller negative values.
The ▲, ▼, ▽ markers and the mojibake-looking spelling â€ are negative.
